ion number, years in operation). Blank facts are hidden; all four blank hides the section. Translatable via Translate & Adapt."},{"type":"text","id":"guarantee_fact_1","label":"Company fact 1"},{"type":"text","id":"guarantee_fact_2","label":"Company fact 2"},{"type":"text","id":"guarantee_fact_3","label":"Company fact 3"},{"type":"text","id":"guarantee_fact_4","label":"Company fact 4"}]}
